age to the corresponding structure of JSON format for CloudEvents - This function applies toDestinationPayloadFormat() to the message data. It also sets the corresponding datacontenttype of the CloudEvent, as indicated by Pipeline.Destination.output_payload_format. If no output_payload_format is set it will use the existing datacontenttype on the CloudEvent if present, else leave datacontenttype absent. - This function expects that the content of the message will adhere to the standard CloudEvent format. If it doesn't then this function will fail. - The result is a CEL map that corresponds to the JSON representation of the CloudEvent. To convert that data to a JSON string it can be chained with the toJsonString function.

